<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Assassin Weapons</h1>
<p>The weapon skills the Assassins' guild teaches. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the weapon there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Each weapon has its own help: help and the weapon's name.
</p>
<pre>Name             Level   Up to
Claw Small           0   100%
Dagger               0   100%
Fist                 0   100%
Short Sword          1   100%
Rapier               4   80%
Falchion             8   80%
Spear               10   80%
Brass Knuckles      12   90%
Kick Small          12   90%
Main Gauche         14   100%
Hand Axe            16   100%
Long Sword          20   90%
Quarterstaff        25   100%
Stiletto            40   90%
</pre>
